  "request": "Generate a 12-frame player dancing spritesheet on a 128x128 calibration tile at exactly 12 fps. Keep one player design with nominal 160px standing height, the same anatomy scale and floor-center foot/root anchor in every frame. Remove the calibration floor, retain complete limbs, and deliver a playable loop. Deliver each sprite in a 192x320px frame with local projected ground anchor (96,248). Arrange the isolated source panels in 4 columns and 3 rows, in the stated frame order. Save original generated images, exact prompts, all references, processed sprites, result.json, and review previews in /Users/yiouchen/.codex/worktrees/1834/tile-foundry/assets/evals/2026-10-16-skill-r3/dancing-player.",
